# design package build artefacts (regenerate with brand/build_design_package.py)
brand/.package-stage/
brand/Auralis-Natura-Design-Package.zip

# ── runtime state the PORTAL writes, never the repo ──────────────────────────
# The Mac launcher and the server updater both deploy with `git reset --hard`,
# so anything tracked here is overwritten on every push. availability.json holds
# Desiree's real consulting hours, edited in the Betriebskonsole; push_tokens.json
# holds live device tokens. Both were tracked, and the first pull that carried
# them would have replaced her schedule with a developer's copy — git refused the
# merge and that is the only reason it did not happen.
# Neither needs seeding: booking.get_availability() writes DEFAULT_AVAILABILITY
# on a fresh install, and the push store starts empty.
portal/config/availability.json
portal/config/push_tokens.json
